      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 35 Solution: Production Optimization Review\n\nExtends Day 33's Production Orchestrator with a 4th Execute Workflow node calling Day 34's Advanced Optimization Engine, plus a Generate Platform Report Set node summarizing all 4 sub-workflows into one overall_platform_health verdict. Import all 4 Week 5 solution files first so the Execute Workflow dropdowns can resolve them. Credentials needed: None — this wraps up workflows you already built.\n\nSee DAILY_TASKS/DAY_35_Production_Optimization_Review.md.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 560
      }
    },
    {
